{"id":1125,"title":{"romaji":"Hidamari no Ki","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"hidamari_no_ki","synopsis":"A story set in the mid-1800's about a young doctor who has been trained in Western-style medicine and a young samurai who is trying to live up to the old traditions of his class and culture. The story is actually based upon real people - the doctor, Ryo-an, was Tezuka's great grandfather.\n\nDuring the Second Year of Ansei (1855) in Edo's Koishigawa are two young men, Manjiro Ibutani and Ryoan Tezuka. Ibutani is a low-ranking samurai who is a gifted swordsman and has a straightforward and strong sense of justice. Tezuka has a more carefree attitude. He has an eye for the ladies, but he is passionate about becoming a doctor. The two opposite characters come of age during the backdrop of the turbulent end of the Tokugawa Period (1600-1868 CE).\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo) ","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2000,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:53","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 03:02:04","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":2694},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":2694},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":2456},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":1508},{"site":"ANN","externalId":2254},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":2603}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2241,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/29cejx4g4aNxtVP5bcEiafA2NaKpIlMwlS5C09XN.png"},{"id":2242,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/2xs1wEYQ25guTbiGVg7JCAAXzOPgd7LzCjDHL18V.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":23,"name":"Madhouse","slug":"madhouse"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":1217,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":1217,"title":{"romaji":"Hidamari no Ki ~Manazashi~","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":1347,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":38,"basename":"HidamariNoKi-OP1.webm","filename":"HidamariNoKi-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/HidamariNoKi-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":17130361,"resolutio